# Development and test dependencies. Runtime packages come from requirements.in
# and are held to the exact versions in the runtime lock (requirements.txt), so
# tests run against what the server runs. Regenerate after editing:
#
#   .venv/bin/pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras \
#     --output-file=requirements-dev.txt requirements-dev.in
-r requirements.in
-c requirements.txt

